    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/373475a4eca5f0993cf9f9c2675b1340.poster.avif?t=1687880003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/373475a4eca5f0993cf9f9c2675b1340.webm?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/373475a4eca5f0993cf9f9c2675b1340.mp4?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In HAXWARE: Enforcer Games you collect power granting gemstones called HAXWARE from clearing a boss, &amp; level them up to do more devastating attacks. There are 5 base elemental HAXWARE, Fire, Water, Wind, Terra, &amp; Electricity, that can be paired to make dozens of more powerful HAXWARE. Every HAXWARE has 4 attributes with points assigned to them, &amp; you can re-arrange these points at any time to fundamentally change how the HAXWARE functions. Take these strategies you discover &amp; face off against both common, &amp; rare bosses!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level up your HAXWARE</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/90c177b14a59fcaaf972ac0294302b14.poster.avif?t=1687880003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/90c177b14a59fcaaf972ac0294302b14.webm?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/90c177b14a59fcaaf972ac0294302b14.mp4?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When you get your first HAXWARE, they will be weak, you will have to level them up to become stronger &amp; do devastating damage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight Challenging Bosses</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/cbcb69d87312eb76eb46e7de9c556a7c.poster.avif?t=1687880003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/cbcb69d87312eb76eb46e7de9c556a7c.webm?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/cbcb69d87312eb76eb46e7de9c556a7c.mp4?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Test you skills against common bosses, &amp; occasional rare ones.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create your own builds</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/ddaade8c845735f9bcfee9367c7ef8e1.poster.avif?t=1687880003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/ddaade8c845735f9bcfee9367c7ef8e1.webm?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/ddaade8c845735f9bcfee9367c7ef8e1.mp4?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2>Alter the attributes on the same HAXWARE to make completely different functioning abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&amp; that's everything! Welcome To The Enforcer Games, Newcomer. Now go &amp; make a name for yourself!</strong></h2>",
