ating damage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight Challenging Bosses</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/cbcb69d87312eb76eb46e7de9c556a7c.poster.avif?t=1687880003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/cbcb69d87312eb76eb46e7de9c556a7c.webm?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/cbcb69d87312eb76eb46e7de9c556a7c.mp4?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Test you skills against common bosses, &amp; occasional rare ones.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create your own builds</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/ddaade8c845735f9bcfee9367c7ef8e1.poster.avif?t=1687880003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/ddaade8c845735f9bcfee9367c7ef8e1.webm?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076830/extras/ddaade8c845735f9bcfee9367c7ef8e1.mp4?t=1687880003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2>Alter the attributes on the same HAXWARE to make completely different functioning abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&amp; that's everything! Welcome To The Enforcer Games, Newcomer. Now go &amp; make a name for yourself!</strong></h2>",
